  "cut_point": "We are given the following information:\n\n- A **10% reduction** in the price of oil.\n- She buys **6 kg more** for **Rs. 900**, meaning:\n  $$\n  \\text{Old price per kg} \\times 6 = 900 \\Rightarrow \\text{Old price per kg} = \\frac{900}{6} = \\text{Rs. 150}\n  $$",
